`tests/`, and the working tree matches both records, so the evidence is consistent — but it's inference, not direct confirmation.\n\nI removed a temporary probe script I had written into the run directory; only `verification-result.json` remains from this stage.","ttft_ms":1714,"ttft_stream_ms":982,"time_to_request_ms":36,"type":"result","duration_ms":167560,"uuid":"469531ec-5cd4-4ccb-be2d-02d3f0275b02"}
